<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Dutch first</p>
<p>division soccer matches played on Saturday:</p>
<p>RKC Waalwijk 1 (Dos Santos 43rd) Feyenoord Rotterdam 1 (Van</p>
<p>Bronckhorst 57th). Halftime 1-0. Attendance not available.</p>
<p>Roda JC Kerkrade 0 AZ Alkmaar 2 (penalty, Heus 63rd, Kooijman</p>
<p>90th). 0-0. Attendance 6,300.</p>
<p>NAC Breda 1 (Arnold 69th) Twente Enschede 2 (Bruggink 43rd,</p>
<p>Bosman 90th). 0-1. 12,716.</p>
<p>Willem II Tilburg 3 (penalty, Van Hintum 6th, Van der Vegt</p>
<p>19th, De Gier 23rd) Groningen 1 (Sion 34th). 3-1. 9,974.</p>
<p>Heerenveen 0 Sparta Rotterdam 0. 13,200.</p>
</text>
